# Whitelist: only the code the images need goes into the build context.
# Dataset files, law_db figure copies, caches, logs and run records never do.
*
!pyproject.toml
!vqa/
!app/
!kb/
!prompts/
!web/
!docker/

# re-excluded inside the whitelisted folders
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
prompts/scene/*/pictograms/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/e2e/.data/
